^{:go/end 273} (go/func init "The control primops. dataToTag# evaluates its argument when it is not evaluated: the tag inference of\nGHC 9.14's STG does not always make it so (a lazy field's value reaches it). Weak pointers' finalizers\nnever run by a GC (a class); finalizeWeak# returns them. Sparks are no-ops (one capability).\n" []
